# Build outputs and local check artefacts stay out of the repository.
# out/ is the default output directory main.py writes to. The program
# clears the contents of out/ on each run but never removes the folder
# itself. Nothing else is ignored.
# (assets/prebuilt.png is the Pillow fallback image; it is committed.)
# out/ is recreated by main.py on every run.
out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
